extends layout.pug

block variables
  - var pageTitle = "Privacy Policy — GoCloud"
  - var pageDescription = "GoCloud's privacy policy explaining how we collect, use, and protect your personal data across our website and services."
  - var pageKeywords = "GoCloud privacy policy, data protection, personal data, GDPR"
  - var canonicalUrl = "https://www.gocloudeg.com/privacy.html"
  - var ogImage = "https://www.gocloudeg.com/images/gocloud-logo.png"

block styles

block content
  include components/preloader.pug
  include components/top-banner.pug
  include components/header.pug

  // Hero Area
  .hero-privacy
    .container
      h1.title Privacy Policy
      p Last Updated: April 2026

  // Privacy Content
  .privacy-section
    .container
      .row
        .col-lg-10.m-auto.privacy-content
          p At GoCloud, we are committed to protecting your privacy and safeguarding your personal information. This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and protect your data when you visit our website or engage with our services.

          h3 1. Information We Collect
          p We may collect the following types of information when you interact with our website — for example, by submitting a contact form, requesting a consultation, or browsing our pages:
          ul
            li
              strong Contact Information:
              |  Name, email address, phone number, company name, and job title.
            li
              strong Technical Data:
              |  IP address, browser type, operating system, referring URLs, and access timestamps.
            li
              strong Usage Data:
              |  Pages visited, time spent on pages, and navigation paths across our website.

          h3 2. How We Use Your Information
          p We use the information we collect for the following purposes:
          ul
            li
              strong Service Delivery:
              |  To respond to your inquiries, provide consultations, and deliver the services you request.
            li
              strong Website Improvement:
              |  To analyze usage patterns and improve our website's content, performance, and user experience.
            li
              strong Communication:
              |  To send relevant updates about our services, only when you have opted in to receive such communications.

          h3 3. Cookies &amp; Tracking Technologies
          p Our website uses cookies and similar technologies to enhance your browsing experience and gather analytics data. You can manage your cookie preferences through your browser settings. We use:
          ul
            li
              strong Essential Cookies:
              |  Required for core website functionality.
            li
              strong Analytics Cookies:
              |  Help us understand how visitors interact with our website (e.g., Google Analytics).

          h3 4. Data Sharing &amp; Third Parties
          p We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information. We may share anonymized, aggregated data with trusted partners for analytics purposes. Any third-party service providers we work with are contractually obligated to protect your data and use it only for the purposes we specify.

          h3 5. Data Security
          p We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. This includes encryption of data in transit, secure server infrastructure, and regular security assessments.

          h3 6. Your Rights
          p You have the right to:
          ul
            li Request access to the personal data we hold about you.
            li Request correction or deletion of your personal data.
            li Opt out of marketing communications at any time.
            li Lodge a complaint with a relevant data protection authority.

          h3 7. Data Retention
          p We retain your personal data only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy or as required by law. When data is no longer needed, it is securely deleted or anonymized.

          h3 8. Contact Us
          p If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your data, please contact us:
          .contact-info-box.mt-3.p-4.rounded-3(style="background: #f8f9fa; border-left: 4px solid #0E38B1;")
            p.mb-2
              strong
                i.fa-solid.fa-building.me-2
                | GoCloud
            p.mb-2
              i.fa-solid.fa-envelope.me-2
              a(href="mailto:marketing@gocloudeg.com") marketing@gocloudeg.com
            p.mb-0
              i.fa-solid.fa-phone.me-2
              a(href="tel:+201017383815") +20 101 738 3815

  include components/footer.pug
  include components/whatsapp-button.pug
